Description: Wild OS desktop icons and right-click menu
 The Wild OS desktop: This computer, the Home folder, the Recycle Bin and
 everything in the Desktop folder as icons down the left of the screen,
 with extensions hidden as in Files. Icons open with a double click, can
 be dragged anywhere or onto folders and the Recycle Bin, renamed with F2,
 selected with a rubber band and moved between with the arrow keys. The
 right-click menus are Wild OS's own: View, Sort by, New, Display
 settings, Personalise and Open in Terminal on the desktop, and Files'
 own item menu on the icons.
 .
 It is a Plasma desktop containment (org.wildos.desktop) and keeps
 Plasma's wallpaper underneath.
